*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0036
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-06-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 756
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0036.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 TERM-MONTHS        PIC 9(3).
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 INTEREST-RATE      PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "INTEREST-RATE=" INTEREST-RATE
    STOP RUN.
3000-TERM-RATE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN TERM-MONTHS >= 1 AND <= 6
            MOVE 0.0275 TO INTEREST-RATE
        *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN TERM-MONTHS >= 7 AND <= 12
            MOVE 0.0350 TO INTEREST-RATE
        *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN TERM-MONTHS >= 13 AND <= 60
            MOVE 0.0425 TO INTEREST-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0150 TO INTEREST-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
